{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>But the dove found no rest.</b> It is not the habit of birds to rest upon the peaks of the high mountains on the earth, and there are no trees there — all the more so when the waters were upon the face of all the earth. And therefore the dove found no resting place that would suit her. And when the trees appeared, she went about for herself, for in their branches she would establish herself."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:26:06.469083724Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}